    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Even these guys wouldnt\nhave enough miles for\nmost frequent flyer\nprograms.\nidgin lugo\nlatu\n[sint\nipsul\nnonus\n¡a aliqu\nrud exer\nsa comm\nprehender\nfillun\n¡usto odio\ne duopt\nprovidd\nsit anim\nlis est\nDis eligen\nxim plac\nnis dolor\n*taut tu\net molr\n-tury sap\n1lat.\naus pec\nimet, co\nnim ad\nutem v\nvero e\n•cat cu\nor sit\nmod\nUt enim ad minimim veniami quis nos\nLorem ipsum dolor s\nmagna aliquam erat vo\nstrud evarri\nThere's one frequent flyer\nprogram that counts how\nmany times you fly, not how\nfar. It's Midway Airlines®\nFlyersFirst™ program. Find\nout how fast and easy it\nis to see the world with\nFlyersFirst. Ask at any\nMidway ticket counter for\nmore information.\nMidway Airlines®",
